    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just hollow advice. you say im not alone because help is \"closer than it feels\" but my actual reality is that i have zero social standing left. i'm a ghost. when everyone has collectively decided you don't matter, there isn't really a \"path forward\" to being part of the world again. it just feels like the world has already moved on without me.",
